 "version": "1.0",
 "title": "Digi Ring",
 "description": "A master ring modulator / tremolo: multiplies the output by a sine carrier. 90 Hz at 40% wet by default (a tremolo); set DIGIRING_FREQ_HZ to a higher rate for a metallic ring. Combines with every mod.",
